n Programme page with PG, UG, and Diploma sections; no programme rows are populated.\"]},{\"type\":\"official_contact_page\",\"url\":\"https://highereducation.mp.gov.in/ContactUSCWReport?page=RAbW2VkultJql7wUdnU7gw%3D%3D&orgid=16\",\"supports\":[\"Institution-specific official Contact Us page; contact fields are currently blank.\"]},{\"type\":\"official_at_a_glance_page\",\"url\":\"https://highereducation.mp.gov.in/CollegeProfile/AtAGlance?orgid=16\",\"supports\":[\"Institution-specific official At A Glance page; profile metrics are largely unpopulated.\"]}],\"website_search_evidence\":[{\"query\":\"\\\"Govt. College, Nalkheda\\\" official website\",\"result\":\"Bing returned no usable institution-specific result; search snippets were not used as verification evidence.\",\"url\":\"https://www.bing.com/search?q=%22Govt.+College%2C+Nalkheda%22+official+website\"},{\"query\":\"site:mp.gov.in Nalkheda college\",\"result\":\"Bing returned no usable institution-specific result; the official Madhya Pradesh Higher Education directory was checked directly.\",\"url\":\"https://www.bing.com/search?q=site%3Amp.gov.in+Nalkheda+college\"}],\"course_catalogue_status\":\"partial_official_website\",\"courses\":[],\"agent_notes\":[\"The NIRF government listing establishes the assigned candidate as Govt. College, Nalkheda, Nalkheda, Madhya Pradesh.\",\"The official Madhya Pradesh Higher Education directory identifies the same Nalkheda campus under its current name Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel Government College, Nalkheda, with orgid 16 and CollegeCode 1908; this resolves the naming difference and campus identity.\",\"The institution-specific official portal exists, but its Regular Courses page has empty PG, UG, and Diploma tables, and its Distance Education page has empty PG, UG, and Diploma tables. No active programme names can be safely imported, so the catalogue is partial and the record requires manual review.\",\"Duration and eligibility were left null because no official programme rows or central catalogue facts were available.\",\"Official Contact Us fields are blank, the How to Reach page is under construction, and the At A Glance profile is largely unpopulated.\",\"Normal TLS verification produced the exact proxy error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain'; after confirming the expected public hostnames, curl --insecure was used only for public GET requests.\",\"No courses were imported and no career mappings were created because the official catalogue contained no programme rows. career_path.db was queried read-only and not edited.\",\"Search-engine snippets were used only for discovery diagnostics, never as verification evidence.\"]}"}}
